# Build output. Rebuilt from src\ by build.cmd in about a second.
bin/

# Fonts are deliberately NOT redistributed.
#
# The day banner is designed for Anurati (by Emmeran Richard), which is licensed
# for personal use only. Bundling it in a public repo would be redistribution,
# which that licence does not allow. Each user downloads it themselves and drops
# it into fonts\ - see fonts\README.txt. Without it the banner falls back to
# Century Gothic and everything still works.
fonts/*.otf
fonts/*.ttf
fonts/*.woff
fonts/*.woff2

# Local scratch
*.log
*.bak
